# Data

This folder contains information related to the dataset used for the Retail Banking Financial Performance & Benchmarking Dashboard.

## Data Source

The financial information used in the project was collected from publicly available bank financial reports and disclosures.

The project covers selected Indian banks across multiple financial years and financial KPIs.

## Data Preparation

The source information was organized and standardized before being incorporated into the Power BI analytical model.

The preparation process included:

- Organizing bank-level financial information
- Standardizing bank names
- Standardizing financial year information
- Standardizing KPI names
- Structuring metric values
- Consolidating bank-level datasets
- Data transformation using Power Query
- Validation and preparation using Excel

## Data Privacy

The project uses publicly available financial information. No confidential customer, account, transaction, or personally identifiable information is included.

## Note

The dataset supports the analysis presented in the Power BI dashboard. The calculated benchmark represents the banks included in the project dataset and should not be interpreted as a benchmark for the entire Indian banking industry.
